<concept id="t00107">
	<title id="e00753">Adjusting the height up and down</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00754">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00755">
								<title>Type A</title>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOV025012.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00756"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e00757">
								<title>Type B (GT)</title>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/OOVGT025001.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00758"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>* Before adjusting the headrest, check the lever position for your seat type.</p>
		<p>To raise the headrest:</p>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<p>Pull it up to the desired position (1).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>To lower the headrest, push and hold the release button (2) on the headrest support.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Lower the headrest to the desired position (3).</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Make sure the headrest locks in position after adjusting it to properly protect the occupants.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="caution">
			<p>If you recline the seatback towards the front with the headrest and seat cushion raised, the headrest may come in contact with the sun visor or other parts of the vehicle.</p>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00759">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig>
									<figgroup>
										<image href="../../images/OOV025014.eps" align="center" height="1.740in" placement="break" id="e00760"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>